<title>USA: Competitive sales total $34 million for Sept 19.</title>
<headline>Competitive sales total $34 million for Sept 19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled competitive sales total $34 million in six offerings for Thursday, September 19, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is a $15 million Tulare, Calif., at 1300 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
